A. The unicycle1 has 0 wheel.
The unicycle2 has 3 wheel.
B. The unicycle1 has 4 wheel.
The unicycle2 has 4 wheel.
C. The unicycle1 has 4 wheel.
The unicycle2 has 3 wheel.
D. The unicycle1 has 0 wheel.
The unicycle2 has 4 wheel.

